%N A401473 Decimal expansion of Sum_{primes p} (p^(1/p) - 1)/p.
%F A401473 Equals Sum_{k>=1} ((-1)^k/k!) * P^(k)(k+1), where P^(k)(s) denotes the k-th derivative of the prime zeta function P(s) = Sum_{p prime} p^(-s) with respect to s.
%F A401473 Equals Sum_{k>=1} (1/k!) * Sum_{p prime} log(p)^k/p^(k+1). The k=1 term is A136271.
%e A401473 0.577032805294820469369457516590806794622559470466786466551387309709093284072585825012929889...
%o A401473 (PARI) \p 170
%o A401473 P(s) = my(c = if(type(s) == "t_SER", polcoef(s, 0), s)); sum(m = 1, 600\c + 1, moebius(m)/m * log(zeta(m*s)));
%o A401473 sum(k = 1, 65, (-1)^k * polcoef(P(k + 1 + x + O(x^(k+1))), k))
%Y A401473 Cf. A000040, A085548, A136271, A401336.
%K A401473 nonn,cons,new
